      "title": "Trump rallies in South Carolina as turmoil grows over Alaska campaign investigation – live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/29/midterm-elections-politics-trump-obama-california-alaska-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>President speaks in Rock Hill, South Carolina; Alaska governor orders inquiry into Mary Peltola campaign amid Republican outcry</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/29/alaska-investigation-mary-peltola-dan-sullivan\">Alaska governor orders investigation into Peltola’s Senate campaign</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US email</a></p></li></ul><p>With days until the midterm elections, a new poll from CNN places Democrats well in the lead in key Senate races in Texas and Michigan, while projecting tighter contests in Kansas and Maine.</p><p>In Texas, the poll found 49% of likely voters would back James Talarico, the Democratic nominee, over Republican Ken Paxton, who netted just 43%.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/29/midterm-elections-politics-trump-obama-california-alaska-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-29T17:30:25"
    },
    {
      "title": "Senate race in once reliably Republican South Carolina tied in final stretch – poll",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/29/south-carolina-senate-tied-race",
      "description": "<p>Democrat Annie Andrews neck-and-neck with Republican incumbent, Darline Graham, sister to Lindsey Graham</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/29/midterm-elections-politics-trump-obama-california-alaska-latest-news-updates\">US politics live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>A US Senate race in one of the most Republican states in the country is now a dead heat, according to a new poll showing Annie Andrews, a Democrat, tied with Darline Graham, the Republican incumbent senator.</p><p>South Carolina has not elected a Democrat to the Senate since 1998, and Donald Trump won it by nearly 18 points in 2024, but a <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2026/10/28/polls/times-siena-sc-poll-crosstabs.html\">New York Times/Siena poll</a> this week has the two candidates neck and neck, at 48% each.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/29/south-carolina-senate-tied-race\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-29T14:42:38"
    }
